ault\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Spanish Translation Expertise<\/b><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Spanish<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, officially known as <\/span><b>Castilian<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in Spain, is spoken as a first language by over 455 million people worldwide and is one of the most widely spoken languages along with English and Chinese. The Spanish language is official for 20 countries, including Spain and most of Central and South America. In the US alone, around 13% of the population (42 million) claim Spanish as their first language.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This enormous number of Spanish speaking people and countries indicates the huge economic value of the language for companies interested in international markets. Fluent communications in Spanish can undoubtedly attract numerous potential consumers in a rapidly growing global market.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spanish is considered one of the critical languages for business in the US, second to English. It is prevalent in mass media and management, where communications with the growing number of Latin communities and employees are of great importance to business. The importance of Spanish in business has been increasing for many years due to the significant production of raw materials and industrial and agricultural products in Latin American countries and the expansion of Spain within the European Union. We can observe the immense international evolution and recognition of the Spanish language within the globalized market.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spanish is a widespread international language, but there are many local variations with cultural, grammatical, and structural nuances depending on the region. Nailing your translation into localized Spanish can be tricky. For instance, the language variations in Spain from North to South and East to West are notable and confusing, as is true in any other Spanish-speaking country. The different parts of any country speak different dialects, use different terminology, and even have their own slang. For this reason, it is so important to use a local translator who knows the local terms and expressions and can translate your text into a language that resonates with the audience the translation is targeting.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1fab47f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1fab47f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9b20313\" data-id=\"9b20313\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b9cbd5 eleme